OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain dying
OL,6,Fout and cloud breaking with the chance
OL,7,Fof some evening sun towards Aberdeen.
OL,8,FClear spells overnight, a few showers
OL,9,Fperhaps reaching the west, windy at
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FBright and breezy with
OL,13,Foccasional showers in the morning,
OL,14,Fespecially for Upper Deeside, mostly
OL,15,Fdry towards Aberdeen and north
OL,16,FAberdeenshire. Fresh winds at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
